@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `pc-travel-nouns`

-- Fixtures for the tests: named facts and builders, and no rules and no assertions. A
-- builder varies the one or two facts a test turns on and fixes the rest at values under
-- which every condition is met, so a test that fails on a builder's default is a finding,
-- not a fixture error. The base case: an adult born 15 June 1990, a leisure trip from
-- 1 April 2026, a 20-day single-trip Period of Insurance (1-20 April 2026) under Plan A,
-- every section in the Schedule, the Policy issued and effective on 1 March 2026.

§ `The Certificate, the Insured Person, the trip`

`every section` MEANS
    LIST `1A Medical Expenses`, `1B Emergency Assistance`, `2 Personal Accident`
       , `3 Baggage and Personal Effects`, `4 Baggage Delay`, `5 Loss of Travel Document`
       , `6 Personal Money`, `7 Travel Delay`, `8 Curtailment of Trip or Cancellation Charges`
       , `9 Personal Liability`, `10 Incidental Home Country`, `11 Rental Car Excess Cover`
       , `12 Optional Rental Car Protection`

`the limits in the test Certificate` MEANS
    `The limits set out in the Insurance Certificate` WITH
        `Medical Expenses`              IS JUST 500_000_000
        `Hospital Cash Allowance`       IS JUST 20_000_000
        `Personal Accident sum insured` IS JUST 1_000_000_000
        `Baggage and Personal Effects`  IS JUST 50_000_000
        `Baggage Delay`                 IS JUST 10_000_000
        `Loss of Travel Document`       IS JUST 15_000_000
        `Personal Money`                IS JUST 10_000_000

`a Certificate stating no limits` MEANS
    `The limits set out in the Insurance Certificate` WITH
        `Medical Expenses`              IS NOTHING
        `Hospital Cash Allowance`       IS NOTHING
        `Personal Accident sum insured` IS NOTHING
        `Baggage and Personal Effects`  IS NOTHING
        `Baggage Delay`                 IS NOTHING
        `Loss of Travel Document`       IS NOTHING
        `Personal Money`                IS NOTHING

GIVEN p     IS A `Plan`
      prod  IS A `Product`
      first IS A DATE
      last  IS A DATE
      lim   IS A `The limits set out in the Insurance Certificate`
GIVETH A `The Insurance Certificate`
`a Certificate for` p prod `from` first `to` last `with` lim MEANS
    `The Insurance Certificate` WITH
        `plan`                                          IS p
        `product`                                       IS prod
        `date of issue of the Policy`                   IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `effective date of the Policy`                  IS YMD 2026 3 1
        `first day of the Period of Insurance`          IS first
        `last day of the Period of Insurance`           IS last
        `sections applicable per the Schedule of Benefit` IS `every section`
        `limits`                                        IS lim
        `premium paid`                                  IS 2_000_000
        `annual premium`                                IS 2_000_000
        `premium received by the Company`               IS TRUE
        `Rental Car Protection applied for in the Application and its additional premium paid` IS TRUE

GIVEN p    IS A `Plan`
      prod IS A `Product`
GIVETH A `The Insurance Certificate`
`a 20-day Certificate for` p prod MEANS
    `a Certificate for` p prod `from` (YMD 2026 4 1) `to` (YMD 2026 4 20) `with` `the limits in the test Certificate`

`the test Certificate` MEANS `a 20-day Certificate for` `Plan A` `a product the wording does not name`

GIVEN born IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The Insured Person`
`a person born` born MEANS
    `The Insured Person` WITH
        `date of birth`                                                   IS born
        `listed and named in the Insurance Certificate as an Insured Person` IS TRUE

`the test Insured Person` MEANS `a person born` (YMD 1990 6 15)

GIVEN purpose  IS A `Purpose of the trip`
      departed IS A DATE
      returned IS A MAYBE DATE
      accompanied IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The trip`
`a trip for` purpose `departing` departed `returning` returned `, with an insured adult` accompanied MEANS
    `The trip` WITH
        `purpose`                                         IS purpose
        `date of departure from the Country of Origin`    IS departed
        `scheduled departure date on the itinerary`       IS departed
        `date of return to the Country of Origin`         IS returned
        `accompanied by an adult also insured under the same Policy` IS accompanied

`the test trip` MEANS `a trip for` `leisure travel` `departing` (YMD 2026 4 1) `returning` NOTHING `, with an insured adult` FALSE

GIVEN cert   IS A `The Insurance Certificate`
      person IS A `The Insured Person`
      trip   IS A `The trip`
GIVETH A `The case`
`a case of` cert person trip MEANS
    `The case` WITH
        `certificate`                                                  IS cert
        `insured person`                                               IS person
        `trip`                                                         IS trip
        `the Insured Person and the claimant observed the terms they were to comply with` IS TRUE
        `every statement in the application forms and declarations is true` IS TRUE
        `a claim was fraudulent or intentionally exaggerated, or a false declaration or statement was made` IS FALSE

`the test case` MEANS `a case of` `the test Certificate` `the test Insured Person` `the test trip`

GIVEN cert IS A `The Insurance Certificate`
GIVETH A `The case`
`the test case under` cert MEANS `a case of` cert `the test Insured Person` `the test trip`

GIVEN observed IS A BOOLEAN
      true     IS A BOOLEAN
      fraud    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The case`
`the test case with conditions` observed true fraud MEANS
    `The case` WITH
        `certificate`                                                  IS `the test Certificate`
        `insured person`                                               IS `the test Insured Person`
        `trip`                                                         IS `the test trip`
        `the Insured Person and the claimant observed the terms they were to comply with` IS observed
        `every statement in the application forms and declarations is true` IS true
        `a claim was fraudulent or intentionally exaggerated, or a false declaration or statement was made` IS fraud

-- An Annual Travel case: a year's Period of Insurance from 1 January 2026, a trip from
-- 1 April 2026.
`an Annual Travel Certificate` MEANS
    `a Certificate for` `Plan A` `Annual Travel` `from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `to` (YMD 2026 12 31) `with` `the limits in the test Certificate`

`an Annual Travel case` MEANS `the test case under` `an Annual Travel Certificate`

§ `Illness, Injury and Disability`

`an event beyond control, by violent, external and visible means` MEANS
    `The facts of an event` WITH
        `entirely beyond the Insured Person's control`       IS TRUE
        `caused by violent, external and visible means`      IS TRUE

`the facts of an Illness` MEANS
    `The facts of an Illness or Injury` WITH
        `kind`                                                        IS `an Illness`
        `a pathological deviation from the normal healthy state`      IS TRUE
        `requires treatment by a Physician, Specialist or Surgeon`    IS TRUE
        `a bodily injury, not a psychiatric condition`                IS FALSE
        `the event that caused it`                                    IS `an event beyond control, by violent, external and visible means`
        `arising wholly and exclusively from that event, independently of all other causes` IS FALSE
        `necessitates medical or surgical treatment`                  IS TRUE

`the facts of an Injury` MEANS
    `The facts of an Illness or Injury` WITH
        `kind`                                                        IS `an Injury`
        `a pathological deviation from the normal healthy state`      IS FALSE
        `requires treatment by a Physician, Specialist or Surgeon`    IS TRUE
        `a bodily injury, not a psychiatric condition`                IS TRUE
        `the event that caused it`                                    IS `an event beyond control, by violent, external and visible means`
        `arising wholly and exclusively from that event, independently of all other causes` IS TRUE
        `necessitates medical or surgical treatment`                  IS TRUE

`no prior history` MEANS
    `The history of a condition` WITH
        `existed before the effective date of the Policy`                     IS FALSE
        `presented signs or symptoms the Insured Person was aware of`         IS FALSE
        `presented signs or symptoms the Insured Person should reasonably have been aware of` IS FALSE

GIVEN existed IS A BOOLEAN
      aware   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The history of a condition`
`a history` existed aware MEANS
    `The history of a condition` WITH
        `existed before the effective date of the Policy`                     IS existed
        `presented signs or symptoms the Insured Person was aware of`         IS aware
        `presented signs or symptoms the Insured Person should reasonably have been aware of` IS FALSE

GIVEN f  IS A `The facts of an Illness or Injury`
      h  IS A `The history of a condition`
      d  IS A DATE
      cs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
      psychiatric IS A BOOLEAN
      pregnancy   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The Disability`
`a Disability from` f `with history` h `on` d `arising from` cs `, a mental disorder` psychiatric `, pregnancy-related` pregnancy MEANS
    `The Disability` WITH
        `facts`                                                   IS f
        `history`                                                 IS h
        `contracted or sustained outside the Country of Origin`  IS TRUE
        `date contracted or sustained`                            IS d
        `arose from`                                              IS cs
        `a psychiatric, psychological, mental or nervous disorder, or insanity` IS psychiatric
        `related to pregnancy`                                    IS pregnancy

GIVEN f  IS A `The facts of an Illness or Injury`
      d  IS A DATE
      cs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
GIVETH A `The Disability`
`a Disability from` f `on` d `arising from` cs MEANS
    `a Disability from` f `with history` `no prior history` `on` d `arising from` cs `, a mental disorder` FALSE `, pregnancy-related` FALSE

`an Illness on 5 April` MEANS `a Disability from` `the facts of an Illness` `on` (YMD 2026 4 5) `arising from` EMPTY
`an Injury on 5 April` MEANS `a Disability from` `the facts of an Injury` `on` (YMD 2026 4 5) `arising from` EMPTY

§ `Medical expenses`

GIVEN k   IS A `Kind of medical expense`
      amt IS A NUMBER
      d   IS A DATE
      outside        IS A BOOLEAN
      breakdown      IS A BOOLEAN
      recommended    IS A BOOLEAN
      otherInsurance IS A BOOLEAN
      corrective     IS A BOOLEAN
      followUp       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A medical expense`
`an expense of` k amt `on` d `, abroad` outside `, itemised` breakdown `, on a Physician's advice` recommended `, insured elsewhere` otherInsurance `, to correct an Injury` corrective `, a follow-up at home` followUp MEANS
    `A medical expense` WITH
        `kind`                                                 IS k
        `amount`                                               IS amt
        `date incurred`                                        IS d
        `incurred outside the Country of Origin`               IS outside
        `a detailed breakdown of charges provided`             IS breakdown
        `supported by original receipts and medical reports with full diagnosis by a Physician` IS TRUE
        `normal, customary and reasonable`                     IS TRUE
        `normal and customary charge for the same in the country where incurred` IS amt
        `normal and customary charge for the same in the country where paid`     IS amt
        `on the recommendation of a Physician`                 IS recommended
        `payable by any other insurance, or a third party may be liable for it` IS otherInsurance
        `incidental to the treatment or diagnosis of a covered Disability` IS TRUE
        `necessitated to correct a condition resulting solely from an external accidental Injury during the Period of Insurance` IS corrective
        `arising immediately following discharge from hospital after return to the Country of Origin` IS followUp

GIVEN k   IS A `Kind of medical expense`
      amt IS A NUMBER
      d   IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A medical expense`
`an expense of` k amt `on` d MEANS
    `an expense of` k amt `on` d `, abroad` TRUE `, itemised` TRUE `, on a Physician's advice` TRUE `, insured elsewhere` FALSE `, to correct an Injury` FALSE `, a follow-up at home` FALSE

GIVEN k   IS A `Kind of medical expense`
      amt IS A NUMBER
      incurredHere IS A NUMBER
      paidHere     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A medical expense`
`an expense of` k amt `against customary charges of` incurredHere `where incurred and` paidHere `where paid` MEANS
    `A medical expense` WITH
        `kind`                                                 IS k
        `amount`                                               IS amt
        `date incurred`                                        IS YMD 2026 4 6
        `incurred outside the Country of Origin`               IS TRUE
        `a detailed breakdown of charges provided`             IS TRUE
        `supported by original receipts and medical reports with full diagnosis by a Physician` IS TRUE
        `normal, customary and reasonable`                     IS TRUE
        `normal and customary charge for the same in the country where incurred` IS incurredHere
        `normal and customary charge for the same in the country where paid`     IS paidHere
        `on the recommendation of a Physician`                 IS TRUE
        `payable by any other insurance, or a third party may be liable for it` IS FALSE
        `incidental to the treatment or diagnosis of a covered Disability` IS TRUE
        `necessitated to correct a condition resulting solely from an external accidental Injury during the Period of Insurance` IS FALSE
        `arising immediately following discharge from hospital after return to the Country of Origin` IS FALSE

GIVEN d        IS A `The Disability`
      expenses IS A LIST OF `A medical expense`
      unable   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Medical Expenses claim`
`a Medical Expenses claim for` d `of` expenses `unable to return` unable MEANS
    `A Medical Expenses claim` WITH
        `the Disability`                                          IS d
        `expenses`                                                IS expenses
        `the Insured Person is unable to return to the Country of Origin, or to the final destination` IS unable

§ `Emergency assistance`

GIVEN treatment IS A BOOLEAN
      dangerous IS A BOOLEAN
      unfit     IS A BOOLEAN
      discontinues IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Physician's findings`
`findings` treatment dangerous unfit discontinues MEANS
    `A Physician's findings` WITH
        `requires treatment by a Physician`                                   IS treatment
        `certified by that Physician as dangerous to life`                    IS dangerous
        `certified unfit to travel or to continue the original journey`       IS unfit
        `results in the Insured Person's discontinuation or cancellation of the original journey` IS discontinues

`serious findings` MEANS `findings` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
`findings that are not serious` MEANS `findings` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN d          IS A `The Disability`
      f          IS A `A Physician's findings`
      facilities IS A BOOLEAN
      approval   IS A BOOLEAN
      ticketValid IS A BOOLEAN
      bills      IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An Emergency Assistance claim`
`an emergency claim for` d `findings` f `facilities nearby` facilities `, approved in advance` approval `, ticket still valid` ticketValid `, bills expected` bills MEANS
    `An Emergency Assistance claim` WITH
        `the Disability`                                          IS d
        `findings`                                                IS f
        `requires immediate treatment`                            IS TRUE
        `adequate medical facilities available in the immediate vicinity` IS facilities
        `prior approval taken from the Company`                   IS approval
        `arranged and coordinated by the Company's designated assistance company` IS TRUE
        `cost of the emergency evacuation`                        IS 300_000_000
        `repatriation medically necessary`                        IS TRUE
        `the original ticket is valid for the purpose`            IS ticketValid
        `the unused portion of the ticket surrendered to the Company` IS TRUE
        `repatriation decided jointly by the attending physician and the Company` IS TRUE
        `cost of the repatriation`                                IS 150_000_000
        `hospital bills expected to amount to`                    IS bills

`the test emergency claim` MEANS
    `an emergency claim for` `an Illness on 5 April` `findings` `serious findings` `facilities nearby` FALSE `, approved in advance` TRUE `, ticket still valid` FALSE `, bills expected` 60_000_000

GIVEN hours IS A NUMBER
      days  IS A NUMBER
      acute IS A BOOLEAN
      satisfactory IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A stay in hospital`
`a stay of` hours `hours over` days `calendar days, acute` acute `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` satisfactory MEANS
    `A stay in hospital` WITH
        `hours as an inpatient`                                   IS hours
        `calendar days on which the Insured Person was an inpatient` IS days
        `the cause is acute`                                      IS acute
        `documentation produced showing the date, time, duration and place, with a copy of the medical report` IS TRUE
        `the documentation is satisfactory to the Company`        IS satisfactory

GIVEN k   IS A `Kind of travel cost`
      amt IS A NUMBER
      by  IS A MAYBE `A person related to the Insured Person`
GIVETH A `A travel or accommodation cost`
`a cost of` k amt `incurred by` by MEANS
    `A travel or accommodation cost` WITH
        `kind`                                                    IS k
        `amount`                                                  IS amt
        `reasonable`                                              IS TRUE
        `additional`                                              IS TRUE
        `incurred by`                                             IS by

GIVEN r IS A `Family relation`
GIVETH A `A person related to the Insured Person`
`the Insured Person's` r MEANS
    `A person related to the Insured Person` WITH
        `relation`                                                IS r
        `a business associate with a share in the Insured Person's business` IS FALSE
        `a travel companion also insured under the same Policy`   IS FALSE

`a Close Business Partner` MEANS
    `A person related to the Insured Person` WITH
        `relation`                                                IS `no family relation the definition names`
        `a business associate with a share in the Insured Person's business` IS TRUE
        `a travel companion also insured under the same Policy`   IS FALSE

`an insured travelling companion` MEANS
    `A person related to the Insured Person` WITH
        `relation`                                                IS `no family relation the definition names`
        `a business associate with a share in the Insured Person's business` IS FALSE
        `a travel companion also insured under the same Policy`   IS TRUE

`a friend` MEANS `the Insured Person's` `no family relation the definition names`

§ `Personal Accident`

GIVEN severance IS A BOOLEAN
      sight     IS A BOOLEAN
      nWeeks    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The facts of a disablement`
`a disablement with severance` severance `, loss of sight entire` sight `, lasting` nWeeks `weeks` MEANS
    `The facts of a disablement` WITH
        `physical severance of a hand at or above the wrist, or of a foot at or above the ankle` IS severance
        `the loss of sight is entire and irrecoverable`           IS sight
        `entirely prevents attending to an occupation or employment of any and every kind` IS TRUE
        `consecutive weeks the disablement has lasted`            IS nWeeks
        `beyond hope of any improvement at the expiry of that period` IS TRUE

GIVEN l        IS A `A loss in the Personal Accident table`
      dis      IS A `The facts of a disablement`
      accident IS A DATE
      loss     IS A DATE
      carrier  IS A MAYBE `A conveyance`
      already  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Personal Accident claim`
`a Personal Accident claim for` l `with` dis `, the Accident on` accident `, the loss on` loss `, on board` carrier `, a benefit already payable` already MEANS
    `A Personal Accident claim` WITH
        `the loss claimed`                                        IS l
        `the Injury`                                              IS `the facts of an Injury`
        `disablement`                                             IS dis
        `date of the Accident`                                    IS accident
        `date of the death or disablement`                        IS loss
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `travelling as a fare-paying passenger on board`          IS carrier
        `a Personal Accident benefit has already become payable for this Insured Person` IS already

`a full disablement` MEANS `a disablement with severance` TRUE `, loss of sight entire` TRUE `, lasting` 52 `weeks`

GIVEN l IS A `A loss in the Personal Accident table`
GIVETH A `A Personal Accident claim`
`a Personal Accident claim for` l MEANS
    `a Personal Accident claim for` l `with` `a full disablement` `, the Accident on` (YMD 2026 4 5) `, the loss on` (YMD 2026 4 5) `, on board` NOTHING `, a benefit already payable` FALSE

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of conveyance`
      public IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A conveyance`
`a conveyance` k `public common carrier` public MEANS
    `A conveyance` WITH
        `kind`                                                     IS k
        `a public common carrier`                                  IS public
        `licensed to carry fare-paying passengers`                 IS TRUE
        `a contractor or private carrier`                          IS NOT public

§ `Baggage, documents and money`

GIVEN k    IS A `Kind of article`
      ld   IS A `Loss or damage`
      amt  IS A NUMBER
      set  IS A MAYBE STRING
      baggage IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An article`
`an article` k ld amt `in set` set `carried as baggage` baggage MEANS
    `An article` WITH
        `kind`                                                    IS k
        `loss or damage`                                          IS ld
        `amount of the loss`                                      IS amt
        `the pair or set it belongs to`                           IS set
        `carried on the journey as baggage`                       IS baggage
        `in consequence of delay, confiscation, detention or examination by customs or other officials` IS FALSE
        `wear and tear, moth, vermin, inherent vice, derangement, cleaning or restoring, atmospheric change, or depreciation` IS FALSE
        `left behind or unattended in a Public Conveyance or a Public Place` IS FALSE
        `mailed or shipped separately`                            IS FALSE
        `specifically insured elsewhere, or recovered or repaired by a third party` IS FALSE
        `lost by armed robbery, or by burglary from a hotel safety deposit box` IS FALSE
        `produced for the Company's inspection`                   IS TRUE

GIVEN k   IS A `Kind of article`
      amt IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An article`
`a lost article` k amt MEANS `an article` k `loss` amt `in set` NOTHING `carried as baggage` TRUE

GIVEN cause    IS A `Cause of a loss of property`
      hours    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      articles IS A LIST OF `An article`
GIVETH A `A Baggage and Personal Effects claim`
`a baggage claim for` cause `reported after` hours `of` articles MEANS
    `A Baggage and Personal Effects claim` WITH
        `cause`                                                   IS cause
        `date of the occurrence`                                  IS YMD 2026 4 6
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `hours from the occurrence to the report to the local police, the carriers or a liable third party` IS hours
        `ordinary and proper care observed`                       IS TRUE
        `in transit when lost or damaged`                         IS TRUE
        `immediate notice given to the police, with written documentation from the local police` IS TRUE
        `immediate notice given to the carriers, with a copy of the Baggage Irregularity Report` IS TRUE
        `articles`                                                IS articles

GIVEN hours     IS A NUMBER
      final     IS A BOOLEAN
      cause     IS A `Cause of a baggage delay`
      purchases IS A LIST OF `An emergency purchase`
GIVETH A `A Baggage Delay claim`
`a baggage delay of` hours `hours, at the final destination` final `, caused by` cause `, buying` purchases MEANS
    `A Baggage Delay claim` WITH
        `cause`                                                   IS cause
        `date of arrival at the destination abroad`               IS YMD 2026 4 1
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `hours of deprivation from arrival at the destination abroad` IS hours
        `the destination abroad is the final destination of the journey` IS final
        `certified by a Baggage Irregularity Report or a tour operator's letter` IS TRUE
        `documentation including original purchase bills produced` IS TRUE
        `the same loss is claimed under section 3`                IS FALSE
        `purchases`                                               IS purchases

GIVEN amt IS A NUMBER
      essential IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An emergency purchase`
`a purchase of` amt `, toiletries or clothing` essential MEANS
    `An emergency purchase` WITH
        `amount`                                                  IS amt
        `essential toiletries or clothing`                        IS essential

GIVEN cause IS A `Cause of a loss of property`
      hours IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      practicable IS A BOOLEAN
      unattended  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Loss of Travel Document claim`
`a passport lost by` cause `, reported after` hours `hours, as soon as practicable` practicable `, left unattended` unattended MEANS
    `A Loss of Travel Document claim` WITH
        `cause`                                                   IS cause
        `date of the loss`                                        IS YMD 2026 4 6
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `during a trip covered by this Policy`                    IS TRUE
        `hours from awareness of the loss to the police report`   IS hours
        `reported as soon as practicable`                         IS practicable
        `a copy of the police report obtained`                    IS TRUE
        `the documents were left unattended in a public place`    IS unattended
        `cost of obtaining replacement passports, air tickets and travel documents` IS 3_000_000
        `additional hotel accommodation and travel expenses, day by day` IS LIST 5_000_000, 2_000_000
        `cost of returning to the Country of Origin`              IS 10_000_000
        `economy class fare for that return`                      IS 8_000_000

GIVEN cause   IS A `Cause of a loss of property`
      police  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      tc      IS A BOOLEAN
      issuer  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      onPerson IS A BOOLEAN
      exchange IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Personal Money claim`
`money lost by` cause `, police after` police `, travelers checks` tc `, issuer after` issuer `, on the person` onPerson `, exchange` exchange MEANS
    `A Personal Money claim` WITH
        `cause`                                                   IS cause
        `date of the loss`                                        IS YMD 2026 4 6
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `amount lost in bank notes, cash or travelers checks`     IS 5_000_000
        `travelers checks among the money lost`                   IS tc
        `hours from the loss to the report to the local police`   IS police
        `hours from the loss to the report to the travelers checks issuer` IS issuer
        `due to error, omission, exchange-rate fluctuation, confiscation or devaluation` IS exchange
        `carried on the person and not left without personal immediate attendance` IS onPerson

§ `Travel delay, cancellation, liability, home visits, cars`

GIVEN cause IS A `Cause of a travel delay`
      hours IS A NUMBER
      para  IS A `Paragraph claimed under section 7`
      rerouted IS A BOOLEAN
      bookedBefore IS A BOOLEAN
      strikeAtEffective IS A BOOLEAN
      strikeAtCommencement IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Travel Delay claim`
`a delay by` cause `of` hours `hours, claiming` para `, re-routed` rerouted `, booked before the strike` bookedBefore `, strike at the effective date` strikeAtEffective `, strike at commencement` strikeAtCommencement MEANS
    `A Travel Delay claim` WITH
        `cause`                                                   IS cause
        `date of the delay`                                       IS YMD 2026 4 10
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `delayed outside the Country of Origin during the Period of Insurance` IS TRUE
        `entirely beyond the control of the Insured Person`       IS TRUE
        `hours of delay`                                          IS hours
        `the Insured Person failed to reconfirm the booking or to check in on time` IS FALSE
        `the booking was confirmed before the industrial action commenced` IS bookedBefore
        `official documentation from the carrier stating the cause, date, time and duration` IS TRUE
        `the strike or industrial action existed at the effective date of the Policy` IS strikeAtEffective
        `the strike or industrial action existed on the scheduled commencement date of travel` IS strikeAtCommencement
        `arises from confiscation or detention by government authorities` IS FALSE
        `paragraph claimed`                                       IS para
        `public transportation expenses necessarily incurred`     IS 20_000_000
        `re-routed because a prior confirmed booking was cancelled` IS rerouted

GIVEN cause IS A `Cause of a travel delay`
      h     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A Travel Delay claim`
`an allowance claim for a delay by` cause `of` h `hours` MEANS
    `a delay by` cause `of` h `hours, claiming` `7(a), the allowance for each 6 hours` `, re-routed` FALSE `, booked before the strike` TRUE `, strike at the effective date` FALSE `, strike at commencement` FALSE

GIVEN kind    IS A `Cancellation or curtailment`
      cause   IS A `A cause named in section 8`
      death   IS A BOOLEAN
      f       IS A `A Physician's findings`
      arose   IS A DATE
      known   IS A BOOLEAN
      disasterAfter IS A BOOLEAN
      prepaid IS A NUMBER
      unused  IS A NUMBER
      extra   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A section 8 claim`
`a section 8 claim for` kind `because of` cause `, a death` death `, findings` f `, the cause arising on` arose `, known at issue` known `, disaster after commencement` disasterAfter `, prepaid` prepaid `, unused` unused `, extra` extra MEANS
    `A section 8 claim` WITH
        `kind`                                                    IS kind
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `cause`                                                   IS cause
        `the cause is a death`                                    IS death
        `findings`                                                IS f
        `date the cause arose`                                    IS arose
        `date of the cancellation or curtailment`                 IS arose
        `the cause arises from conditions or circumstances known to exist on the date of issue of the Policy` IS known
        `arises from pregnancy, childbirth or gynecological disease or their sequelae` IS FALSE
        `the Insured Person abandoned the planned trip, or cut it short by returning to the Country of Residence or Origin` IS TRUE
        `the natural disaster occurred suddenly after commencement of travel and prevents continuing the trip` IS disasterAfter
        `the destruction was by fire, flood, earthquake or similar disaster after commencement of travel and requires the Insured Person's presence` IS disasterAfter
        `non-refundable prepaid travel and accommodation charges`  IS prepaid
        `unused portion of those charges, as a fraction`          IS unused
        `increased cost of travel by the least expensive alternative, or of reasonable accommodation` IS extra

GIVEN harm  IS A `Kind of harm to a third party`
      cs    IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in section 9(ii)`
      j     IS A `Judgement on the liability`
      damages IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A Personal Liability claim`
`a liability for` harm `arising from` cs `, judgement` j `, damages` damages MEANS
    `A Personal Liability claim` WITH
        `date of the event`                                       IS YMD 2026 4 8
        `harm`                                                    IS harm
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `arose from, under section 9(ii)`                         IS cs
        `payable by any other insurance company or third party`   IS FALSE
        `judgement`                                               IS j
        `damages for the legal liability`                         IS damages
        `the third party's reasonable costs and expenses`         IS 50_000_000
        `legal costs and expenses`                                IS 20_000_000

GIVEN days        IS A NUMBER
      medical     IS A BOOLEAN
      unexpected  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A return to the Country of Origin`
`a return home for` days `days, for medical treatment` medical `, for an unexpected reason` unexpected MEANS
    `A return to the Country of Origin` WITH
        `the Insured Person had departed from the Country of Origin` IS TRUE
        `consecutive days in the Country of Origin`               IS days
        `the cause arises from circumstances known to the Insured Person before or on the effective date` IS FALSE
        `for the purpose of seeking medical treatment`            IS medical
        `for an unexpected reason`                                IS unexpected

GIVEN licensed   IS A BOOLEAN
      recognized IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A car rental company`
`a rental company, licensed` licensed `, recognized` recognized MEANS
    `A car rental company` WITH
        `licensed`                                                IS licensed
        `recognized`                                              IS recognized

GIVEN excess  IS A NUMBER
      company IS A `A car rental company`
      offRoad IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Rental Car Excess claim`
`an excess of` excess `, renting from` company `, off a public road` offRoad MEANS
    `A Rental Car Excess claim` WITH
        `date of the loss or damage`                              IS YMD 2026 4 9
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `excess under a valid Car Insurance Policy the Insured Person is liable to pay` IS excess
        `for accidental loss of or damage to a car rented by the Insured Person` IS TRUE
        `the Insured Person was the driver and is specified in the car rental contract` IS TRUE
        `rental company`                                          IS company
        `comprehensive car insurance bought as part of the rental contract` IS TRUE
        `complied with the rental contract, the car insurance policy and local law` IS TRUE
        `due to a breach of the rental contract or car insurance policy, or a violation of local law` IS FALSE
        `occurred outside a public road`                          IS offRoad
        `due to wear and tear, insect or rodent, depreciation, inherent vice, or implicit damage` IS FALSE

GIVEN cause   IS A `Cause of damage to a rental car`
      vehicle IS A `Kind of rented vehicle`
      company IS A `A car rental company`
      damage  IS A NUMBER
      papers  IS A BOOLEAN
      intoxicated IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A Rental Car Protection claim`
`rental car damage by` cause `to` vehicle `from` company `of` damage `, papers submitted` papers `, intoxicated` intoxicated MEANS
    `A Rental Car Protection claim` WITH
        `cause`                                                   IS cause
        `date of the loss or damage`                              IS YMD 2026 4 9
        `arose from`                                              IS EMPTY
        `vehicle`                                                 IS vehicle
        `rental company`                                          IS company
        `damage for which the Insured Person is responsible under the rental agreement` IS damage
        `police report, itemized statement of repairs and other evidence submitted` IS papers
        `the Insured Person cooperated with the Company`         IS TRUE
        `driving whilst intoxicated or under the influence of drugs or narcotics` IS intoxicated
        `intentional loss or damage`                              IS FALSE
        `an obligation the Insured Person assumed under an agreement` IS FALSE
        `use of the car in violation of the rental agreement`     IS FALSE
        `a liability, personal Injury or property damage`         IS FALSE

§ `Claims`

GIVEN notice IS A MAYBE DATE
      written IS A BOOLEAN
      incident IS A DATE
      request  IS A MAYBE DATE
      received IS A MAYBE DATE
      disclaimed IS A MAYBE DATE
      referred   IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `The dates of a claim`
`claim dates: notice` notice `in writing` written `, incident` incident `, request` request `, received` received `, disclaimed` disclaimed `, referred` referred MEANS
    `The dates of a claim` WITH
        `date notice of the claim was given`                      IS notice
        `notice given in writing`                                 IS written
        `date of the incident`                                    IS incident
        `date the trip covered by this Policy finished`           IS YMD 2026 4 15
        `date of the Company's written request for further information` IS request
        `date the required information was received`              IS received
        `date the Company disclaimed liability`                   IS disclaimed
        `date the claim was referred to dispute resolution`       IS referred
